    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 5,
    "title": "Express extreme degree with 死了 or 得厉害",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-complements-p01-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express extreme degree with 死了 or 得厉害",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Compatible adjectives can take 死了 for an extreme, figurative degree. 得厉害 also marks strong degree. In 死了, 了 is le, not liǎo.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我累死了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ lèi sǐ le 。",
                "meaning": "I am exhausted.",
                "audio": "7a42987f5e411b31993194ff9fd41943371f5ca98cffb49174fc6a0cf30ce1ef"
              },
              {
                "text": "他疼得厉害。",
                "pinyin": "tā téng de lìhai 。",
                "meaning": "He is in severe pain.",
                "audio": "25a74cb250f2b44a0090ed5a9e904efa76db8dd4b9614def10bfdafa2c28e137"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "死",
                "pinyin": "sǐ",
                "meaning": "rigidly; to an extreme degree",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "dc5fd132b0a595c5e4635d5f98a4cc43a99e919bfaf4222714ca6f194c4d9bea"
              },
              {
                "text": "了",
                "pinyin": "le",
                "meaning": "aspect or change-of-situation particle; not a past-tense ending",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "90e3611d8b6518d478d1242948ff62d4fa8f51abdebc5a7fcc8a631a7665ece6"
              },
              {
                "text": "得",
                "pinyin": "de",
                "meaning": "used after a verb to describe how it is done",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "feade6b6cd3314f53fb111bf868bff38873a809eff388c7e7ebcc17b83626cfd"
              },
              {
                "text": "厉害",
                "pinyin": "lìhai",
                "meaning": "formidable; severe; impressive",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "99e3ff6150e21cc5adddaa26fda534c213921ac65c0b520d0ba48a967e7a9ef5"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
